STEP 4 — the hop-count threshold is enforced at its documented default of 10
================================================================================
A matched pair, same bench, differing only in the hops field of the crafted DISCOVER.
`ip dhcp-relay maxhops` was left at its default; `show ip dhcp-relay` reports
"Maximum hop count is 10".

  leg `hops2`  — DISCOVER crafted with hops=2:
    eth3 sent 10, eth4 relayed 10, replies 10, offers 5/5, acks 5/5
    arriving at the server with **hops=3** (incremented from 2), giaddr=192.168.10.1
  leg `hops10` — DISCOVER crafted with hops=10 (at the threshold):
    eth3 sent 4, eth4 relayed **0**, replies 0, offers 0/5

A frame two hops out is relayed and counted up; a frame already at the threshold is dropped.
STEP 4 PASS.

